internet-monitor (1.0.7-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Honor NODE_NUMBER from the environment during install so noninteractive
    installs (asl3_mapp.rb -m) no longer fail in debconf
  * Make dpkg-reconfigure actually prompt and write the new node number
  * Stop looping forever when no terminal is available; fail with a hint

 -- Jory A. Pratt (W5GLE) <geekypenguin@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 11:00:00 -0500

internet-monitor (1.0.6-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Re-read /etc/resolv.conf on every DNS check; the default resolver cached
    an empty config from boot and caused NetworkManager restart loops
  * Start after network-online.target and wait up to 60s for a nameserver

 -- Jory A. Pratt (W5GLE) <geekypenguin@gmail.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:30:00 -0500

