internet-monitor (1.0.5-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Do not play reconnect audio on service startup when already online
  * Check Asterisk playback exit status; stop using which for command lookup
  * Sleep in 1s steps so SIGTERM stops within one second of the interval
  * debconf config: read NODE_NUMBER from .dpkg-new during first install
  * Remove undefined ${ruby:Depends} substitution from package Depends
  * Add configurable DNS_TEST_HOST for connectivity checks
  * Enable and start systemd service on successful package configure (debhelper)
  * Skip service start when NODE_NUMBER is missing (ExecStartPre guard)
  * CI: run lintian --fail-on error on built packages

 -- Jory A. Pratt (W5GLE) <geekypenguin@gmail.com>  Fri, 12 Jun 2026 20:00:00 +0000

